@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

== C2C user purchases ==

Customer -> Offering : decides purchase a VAS
Offering --> Customer : returns available offering

Customer -> Order : asks Order to create an order
Order -> Order : a draft Order
Order --> Customer : returns url of the payment providers

Customer -> PaymentProvider : pays the order
PaymentProvider -> PaymentProvider : confirms payment
PaymentProvider ->> PaymentProvider : notifies "PaymentCompleted"

[-> Order : PaymentCompleted
Order -> Order : the Order as Paid

== VAS scheduled and no VAS in Wallet ==

Business_User -> VASScheduling : schedules VAS
VASScheduling -> Wallet : to reserve a VAS
Wallet -> Wallet : an unconfirmed VAS reservation
Wallet ->> Wallet : notifies "VAS Addition Request Approved"
VASScheduling -> VASScheduling : a VAS schedule

[-> VASScheduling : VAS Addition Request Approved
VASScheduling -> OrderManagement : to create an Order
OrderManagement ->> OrderManagement : notifies "Order Created"
OrderManagement -> OrderManagement : the Order as payment deferred
OrderManagement ->> OrderManagement : notifies "Order payment deferred"

[-> OrderFulfilment : Order payment deferred
OrderFulfilment -> WalletItemAddition : to fulfil the addition request
WalletItemAddition -> Wallet : to add VAS
Wallet ->> Wallet : notifies "VAS added"

[-> OrderFulfilment : VAS added
OrderFulfilment -> OrderManagement : to mark the Order as fulfiled
OrderManagement ->> OrderManagement : notifies "Order completed"

== VAS scheduled and VAS in Wallet ==

Business_User -> VASScheduling : schedules VAS
VASScheduling -> Wallet : to reserve a VAS
Wallet -> Wallet : a VAS
Wallet ->> Wallet : notifies "VAS Reserved"
VASScheduling -> VASScheduling : a VAS schedule

== VAS unscheduled ==

Business_User -> VASScheduling : unschedules VAS scheduling
VASScheduling -> Wallet : to cancel the VAS reservation
Wallet -> Wallet : cancels VAS reservation
Wallet ->> Wallet : notifies "VAS Reservation Canceled"
VASScheduling -> VASScheduling : the VAS schedule

== VAS expires ==

CRON -> Wallet : identifies VAS expiring
Wallet -> Wallet : removes VAS
Wallet ->> Wallet : notifies "VAS Expired"

== Purchase VAS schedule and its renewal (ideal scenario) ==

Business_User -> OrderMgmt : schedules VAS
OrderMgmt -> OrderMgmt : an Order with two items to fulfil: VAS and VAS Subscription
OrderMgmt ->> OrderMgmt : notifies "Order Created"
OrderMgmt -> OrderMgmt : the Order as payment deferred
OrderMgmt ->> OrderMgmt : notifies "Order payment deferred"

[-> OrderFulfilment : Order payment deferred
OrderFulfilment -> VASMgmt : to schedule the VAS
VASMgmt -> VASMgmt : the VAS for future application
VASMgmt ->> VASMgmt : notifies "VAS scheduled"

[-> OrderFulfilment : VAS scheduled
OrderFulfilment -> Subscription : to create a VAS Subscription
Subscription -> Subscription : a VAS Subscription with the details
OrderFulfilment -> OrderFulfilment : the vas subscription item as Fulfiled

== Purchase VAS schedule and its renewal (current possible scenario) ==

Business_User -> VASMgmt : schedules VAS
VASMgmt -> VASMgmt : a VAS for future application
VASMgmt ->> VASMgmt : notifies "VAS scheduled with subscription included"

[-> Subscription : VAS scheduled with subscription included
Subscription -> Subscription : a VAS Subscription with the details

== Scheduled VAS Applied ==

VASMgmt -> VASMgmt : identifies scheduled VAS to apply
VASMgmt -> VASMgmt : a VAS and stores details until when its valid
VASMgmt ->> VASMgmt : notifies "VAS Applied"

== VAS Renewal Flow ==

VASMgmt -> VASMgmt : identifies VAS expired
VASMgmt -> VASMgmt : the VAS as expired
VASMgmt ->> VASMgmt : notifies "VAS expired"

[-> Subscription : VAS expired
Subscription -> Subscription : checks if VAS has active associated subscription
Subscription -> VASMgmt : to schedule/apply a new VAS
Subscription -> Subscription : the VAS Subscription with the VAS
Susbscription ->> Susbscription : notifies "VAS Subscription Renewed"

== Stop Auto-Renewal ==

Business_User -> Subscription : stops VAS Auto-Renewal
Subscription -> Subscription : the subscription

@enduml